./docs/WORK-ORDERS.md:30:**What it is:** make the bare Build loop (`submit → plan → approve → execute → produce output → revise → re-plan → execute → verify output`) boringly reliable BEFORE any higher-level Build primitive (AppKit, Cloudflare export, visual editing) is promoted to the main product path. A deterministic evidence-oracle harness — agents may explain/patch/RCA but NEVER adjudicate; only deterministic checks over frozen evidence decide PASS/FAIL/INVALID_RUN/INFRA_FAILURE.
